<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/seo-head', { site, services, seo }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="nav-overlay" id="nav-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="site-top" id="site-top">
    <div class="container site-top-inner">
      <header class="site-header" id="site-header">
        <div class="header-inner">
          <a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="<%= site.name %> home">VV<span class="logo-accent">Cosmic</span></a>
          <div class="header-actions">
            <a href="tel:<%= site.phone.replace(/\s/g, '') %>" class="header-phone"><%= site.phoneDisplay %></a>
            <button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="primary-nav">
              <span></span>
              <span></span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary" id="primary-nav">
        <a href="#philosophy">Philosophy</a>
        <a href="#methodology">Process</a>
        <a href="#spatial">Spatial</a>
        <a href="#domains">Practice</a>
        <a href="#reflections">Reflections</a>
        <a href="tel:<%= site.phone.replace(/\s/g, '') %>" class="nav-phone"><%= site.phoneDisplay %></a>
        <a href="/booking" class="nav-cta">Begin Inquiry</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="hero-layer hero-layer-1"></div>
        <div class="hero-layer hero-layer-2"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="container hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="hero-eyebrow reveal"><%= site.practitioner %> · <%= site.tagline %></p>
          <h1 class="hero-title reveal" id="hero-heading">Hidden patterns shape visible life. Observation precedes alignment.</h1>
          <p class="hero-subtitle reveal">A private advisory practice for those who sense recurring structures beneath career, relationships, environment, and inner life — and seek intelligent refinement, not prediction.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions reveal">
            <a href="/booking" class="btn btn-primary">Begin Your Inquiry</a>
            <a href="#philosophy" class="btn btn-ghost">Explore the Approach</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <%- include('partials/hero-lotus') %>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-scroll-hint reveal" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Scroll</span>
        <div class="scroll-line"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section philosophy section-texture section-decorated" id="philosophy" aria-labelledby="philosophy-heading">
      <%- include('partials/carving-texture', { carvingLeft: true, carvingRight: false }) %>
      <div class="section-grid-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <span class="section-label">Philosophy</span>
          <h2 id="philosophy-heading">Patterns repeat until they are seen clearly</h2>
          <p class="section-lead">The work begins with observation — chart intelligence, behavioral loops, environmental influence, and the subconscious structures that shape how life unfolds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-grid">
          <article class="philosophy-card reveal">
            <%- include('partials/lotus-icon', { lotusClass: 'lotus-icon lotus-icon--card' }) %>
            <h3>Recurring Life Patterns</h3>
            <p>What appears as coincidence is often structure — themes that return across relationships, work, and inner experience until awareness shifts how they express.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="philosophy-card reveal">
            <%- include('partials/lotus-icon', { lotusClass: 'lotus-icon lotus-icon--card' }) %>
            <h3>Karmic Continuity</h3>
            <p>Not punishment, but inherited pattern tendencies — unconscious repetition, unresolved imbalance, and tendencies carried forward through thought, speech, and action.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="philosophy-card reveal">
            <%- include('partials/lotus-icon', { lotusClass: 'lotus-icon lotus-icon--card' }) %>
            <h3>Environmental Intelligence</h3>
            <p>Surroundings influence clarity, emotional state, and decision-making. Space is treated as architecture of behavior — not superstition, but spatial psychology.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="philosophy-card reveal">
            <%- include('partials/lotus-icon', { lotusClass: 'lotus-icon lotus-icon--card' }) %>
            <h3>Refinement Through Awareness</h3>
            <p>Transformation is not dramatic revelation — it is the quiet recalibration of how you think, speak, act, and inhabit your environment each day.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <div class="philosophy-note reveal">
          <p>"Karma is not a verdict. It is the pattern beneath the pattern — and awareness is how repetition becomes choice."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section life-architecture section-decorated" id="life-architecture" aria-labelledby="architecture-heading">
      <%- include('partials/carving-texture', { carvingLeft: false, carvingRight: true }) %>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="architecture-inner">
          <div class="architecture-content reveal">
            <span class="section-label">Life Architecture</span>
            <h2 id="architecture-heading">The hidden structures influencing outcomes</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">Career stagnation, relational friction, emotional volatility, and environmental discomfort often share a root — structures operating beneath conscious awareness.</p>
            <p>Life architecture maps how chart patterns, daily rhythm, speech habits, emotional cycles, and spatial environment intersect. The goal is not more information, but integrated understanding of why certain outcomes persist.</p>
            <ul class="architecture-list">
              <li>Cross-domain pattern mapping</li>
              <li>Behavioral and energetic observation</li>
              <li>Root cause beneath surface symptoms</li>
              <li>Strategic alignment across life domains</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="architecture-visual reveal" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="architecture-diagram">
              <div class="arch-layer arch-layer-1"><span>Chart</span></div>
              <div class="arch-layer arch-layer-2"><span>Behavior</span></div>
              <div class="arch-layer arch-layer-3"><span>Environment</span></div>
              <div class="arch-core"><span>Alignment</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section methodology" id="methodology" aria-labelledby="methodology-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <span class="section-label">Strategic Alignment Process</span>
          <h2 id="methodology-heading">A layered advisory methodology</h2>
          <p class="section-lead">Each engagement follows a deliberate sequence — deep observation before conclusion, root analysis before correction, refinement integrated into daily life.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="phases">
          <article class="phase reveal">
            <div class="phase-header">
              <span class="phase-label">Phase 01</span>
              <h3>Pattern Observation</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="phase-purpose">Understanding the current life architecture — before any strategic direction is offered.</p>
            <ul class="phase-list">
              <li>Chart analysis & recurring life themes</li>
              <li>Emotional tendencies & behavioral observation</li>
              <li>Environmental influences on clarity & state</li>
              <li>Current concerns & personal context</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="phase-note">Observation precedes conclusion</p>
          </article>
          <article class="phase reveal phase--featured">
            <div class="phase-header">
              <span class="phase-label">Phase 02</span>
              <h3>Lifestyle & Root Cause Analysis</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="phase-purpose">Understanding why patterns continue repeating beneath the surface — the core differentiator of this practice.</p>
            <ul class="phase-list">
              <li>Daily rhythm & routine observation</li>
              <li>Thought patterns, speech habits & emotional cycles</li>
              <li>Environmental alignment leakage & karmic repetition</li>
              <li>Environmental friction in living & workspace</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="phase-note">Why repetition persists</p>
          </article>
          <article class="phase reveal">
            <div class="phase-header">
              <span class="phase-label">Phase 03</span>
              <h3>Alignment & Strategic Correction</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="phase-purpose">Refinement and implementation — personalized, intelligent, integrated into how you live.</p>
            <ul class="phase-list">
              <li>Thought, speech & action alignment</li>
              <li>Behavioral recalibration & spatial correction</li>
              <li>Environmental alignment & lifestyle refinement</li>
              <li>Strategic guidance & follow-through</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="phase-note">Correction with intention</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section services domains" id="domains" aria-labelledby="domains-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <span class="section-label">Practice Domains</span>
          <h2 id="domains-heading">Observational domains of the advisory practice</h2>
          <p class="section-lead">Not a menu of services — a curated framework for how hidden patterns are observed, understood, and refined across life.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="services-grid">
          <% practiceDomains.forEach(function(d, i) { %>
          <article class="service-card reveal" id="<%= d.slug %>">
            <%- include('partials/lotus-icon', { lotusClass: 'lotus-icon lotus-icon--card' }) %>
            <h3><%= d.name %></h3>
            <p><%= d.description %></p>
            <ul class="service-features">
              <% d.aspects.forEach(function(a) { %>
              <li><%= a %></li>
              <% }); %>
            </ul>
            <a href="/booking?service=<%= d.id %>" class="service-link">Request <%= d.name %> →</a>
          </article>
          <% }); %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section alignment section-decorated" id="alignment" aria-labelledby="alignment-heading">
      <%- include('partials/carving-texture', { carvingLeft: true, carvingRight: false }) %>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="alignment-inner">
          <div class="alignment-content reveal">
            <span class="section-label">Lifestyle Alignment</span>
            <h2 id="alignment-heading">Transformation requires alignment across every layer</h2>
            <p>True refinement extends beyond chart analysis into how you think, speak, act, and inhabit your environment. Misalignment in any layer allows old patterns to persist — quietly, persistently.</p>
            <div class="alignment-pillars">
              <div class="pillar">
                <h4>Thought</h4>
                <p>Inner narratives and mental loops that precede action</p>
              </div>
              <div class="pillar">
                <h4>Speech</h4>
                <p>How language reinforces or dissolves patterns</p>
              </div>
              <div class="pillar">
                <h4>Action</h4>
                <p>Daily choices that embody or contradict awareness</p>
              </div>
              <div class="pillar">
                <h4>Environment</h4>
                <p>Spatial and rhythmic context shaping behavior</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="alignment-diagram reveal" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="diagram-ring ring-outer"></div>
            <div class="diagram-ring ring-middle"></div>
            <div class="diagram-ring ring-inner"></div>
            <div class="diagram-center"><span>Alignment</span></div>
            <span class="diagram-node node-1">Thought</span>
            <span class="diagram-node node-2">Speech</span>
            <span class="diagram-node node-3">Action</span>
            <span class="diagram-node node-4">Environment</span>
            <span class="diagram-node node-5">Routine</span>
            <span class="diagram-node node-6">Awareness</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section spatial spatial-blueprint" id="spatial" aria-labelledby="spatial-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="spatial-grid">
          <div class="spatial-visual">
            <figure class="spatial-blueprint-frame">
              <img
                src="/images/vastu-purusha-blueprint.jpg"
                alt="Spatial intelligence blueprint — Purusha Mandala architectural diagram"
                width="1024"
                height="682"
                loading="eager"
                decoding="async"
              >
            </figure>
          </div>
          <div class="spatial-content reveal">
            <span class="section-label">Spatial Intelligence</span>
            <h2 id="spatial-heading">How environment shapes clarity and behavior</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">Spatial intelligence examines how architecture, light, flow, and directional intelligence influence emotional state, decision-making, and the subtle friction that disrupts inner calm.</p>
            <ul class="spatial-points">
              <li>Home and workspace environmental alignment architecture</li>
              <li>Environmental psychology of living spaces</li>
              <li>Spatial correction without superstitious framing</li>
              <li>Surroundings as an extension of behavioral patterns</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/booking" class="btn btn-secondary">Spatial Intelligence Review</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section client-experience" id="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <span class="section-label">Client Experience</span>
          <h2 id="experience-heading">A selective, private advisory process</h2>
          <p class="section-lead">Engagements are intentionally limited. Each inquiry is reviewed personally. The experience is confidential, immersive, and structured — not a transactional reading.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="experience-grid">
          <div class="experience-item reveal">
            <%- include('partials/lotus-icon', { lotusClass: 'lotus-icon lotus-icon--feature' }) %>
            <h3>Private & Confidential</h3>
            <p>Your context, patterns, and concerns remain entirely between you and <%= site.practitioner %>. No mass sessions, no public exposure.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="experience-item reveal">
            <%- include('partials/lotus-icon', { lotusClass: 'lotus-icon lotus-icon--feature' }) %>
            <h3>Deeply Personalized</h3>
            <p>Every engagement is built from your life architecture — chart, behavior, environment, and stated concerns — not generic templates.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="experience-item reveal">
            <%- include('partials/lotus-icon', { lotusClass: 'lotus-icon lotus-icon--feature' }) %>
            <h3>Thoughtfully Paced</h3>
            <p>Observation takes time. The process respects depth over speed — clarity emerges through sustained attention, not instant answers.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section testimonials" id="reflections" aria-labelledby="reflections-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <span class="section-label">Reflections</span>
          <h2 id="reflections-heading">What clients describe after the process</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="testimonial-grid">
          <blockquote class="testimonial reveal">
            <p>"The clarity was quiet, not dramatic. I stopped reacting to the same patterns and began understanding the structure beneath them."</p>
            <footer><cite>— Client, Mumbai</cite><span>Pattern Observation</span></footer>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote class="testimonial reveal">
            <p>"Small spatial adjustments created a noticeable shift in emotional stability. I hadn't considered how much my workspace was influencing my decisions."</p>
            <footer><cite>— Client, Ahmedabad</cite><span>Spatial Intelligence</span></footer>
          </blockquote>
          <blockquote class="testimonial reveal">
            <p>"Less confusion, more internal steadiness. The guidance helped me align daily choices with what I actually understood about my patterns."</p>
            <footer><cite>— Client, Delhi</cite><span>Alignment Intensive</span></footer>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section consultations engagements" id="engagements" aria-labelledby="engagements-heading">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header reveal">
          <span class="section-label">Private Engagements</span>
          <h2 id="engagements-heading">Selective consultation formats</h2>
          <p class="section-lead">Each format is designed for a specific depth of observation. <%= site.practitioner %> reviews every inquiry before confirmation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="consultation-grid">
          <% consultations.forEach(function(c) { %>
          <article class="consultation-card reveal">
            <h3><%= c.name %></h3>
            <p class="consultation-duration"><%= c.duration %></p>
            <p class="consultation-desc"><%= c.description %></p>
            <p class="consultation-price"><%= c.currency %> <%= c.price.toLocaleString('en-IN') %></p>
            <a href="/booking?consultation=<%= c.id %>" class="btn btn-secondary">Begin Inquiry</a>
          </article>
          <% }); %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section cta-section">
      <div class="container cta-inner reveal">
        <h2>When patterns repeat,<br>observation is the first correction.</h2>
        <p class="cta-lead">Submit a private inquiry. Share your context thoughtfully — each request is reviewed personally.</p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a href="/booking" class="btn btn-primary">Begin Your Inquiry</a>
          <a href="tel:<%= site.phone.replace(/\s/g, '') %>" class="btn btn-ghost-light">Call <%= site.phoneDisplay %></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <div class="footer-brand-mark">
          <%- include('partials/lotus-icon', { lotusClass: 'lotus-icon lotus-icon--footer' }) %>
          <span class="logo">VV<span class="logo-accent">Cosmic</span></span>
        </div>
        <p><%= site.practitioner %> — Pattern Intelligence & Life Alignment Advisory</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Practice</h4>
        <nav aria-label="Practice domains">
          <% practiceDomains.forEach(function(d) { %>
          <a href="#<%= d.slug %>"><%= d.name %></a>
          <% }); %>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Explore</h4>
        <nav aria-label="Footer">
          <a href="#philosophy">Philosophy</a>
          <a href="#methodology">Process</a>
          <a href="#spatial">Spatial</a>
          <a href="#alignment">Alignment</a>
          <a href="#reflections">Reflections</a>
          <a href="/booking">Begin Inquiry</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Contact</h4>
        <p><a href="tel:<%= site.phone.replace(/\s/g, '') %>"><%= site.phoneDisplay %></a></p>
        <p><a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a></p>
        <p><%= site.location %></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container footer-bottom">
      <%- include('partials/lotus-icon', { lotusClass: 'lotus-icon lotus-icon--footer-bottom' }) %>
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= site.name %>.com · <%= site.practitioner %>. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
